### ============================================
### 分类/评论/标签 模块测试 (:8084/:8085/:8087)
### ============================================

### 1. 分类树
GET http://localhost:8080/category/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 创建分类
# @name createCategory
POST http://localhost:8080/category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "技术分类",
  "parentId": 0,
  "description": "技术文章分类",
  "sort": 1
}

> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.data); %}

### 3. 分类详情
GET http://localhost:8080/category/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 更新分类
PUT http://localhost:8080/category/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "技术分类V2",
  "description": "更新描述",
  "sort": 1
}

### 5. 删除分类
DELETE http://localhost:8080/category/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 评论模块 ==========

### 6. 发表评论
# @name createComment
POST http://localhost:8080/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": "这是一条测试评论",
  "parentId": 0
}

> {% client.global.set("commentId", response.body.data); %}

### 7. 回复评论
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": "回复内容",
  "parentId": {{commentId}},
  "replyToId": {{commentId}}
}

### 8. 评论分页列表
GET http://localhost:8080/comment?current=1&size=10&articleId=1&status=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 审核评论（1通过 2拒绝）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/comment/{{commentId}}/audit?status=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 删除评论
DELETE http://localhost:8080/comment/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 标签模块 ==========

### 11. 标签列表
GET http://localhost:8080/tag
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 热门标签
GET http://localhost:8080/tag/hot?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 创建标签
# @name createTag
POST http://localhost:8080/tag
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java",
  "slug": "java"
}

> {% client.global.set("tagId", response.body.data); %}

### 14. 标签详情
GET http://localhost:8080/tag/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 更新标签
PUT http://localhost:8080/tag/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java-后端",
  "slug": "java-backend"
}

### 16. 删除标签
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tag/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
